    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d669">

                <pb facs="1334" n="1312" sameAs="frus:frus1946v01/pg1312"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.0031/4–1246</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by President Truman to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1946-04-12">April 12, 1946</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I read your memorandum of the fourth in regard to Trade-agreement Negotiations
                    with a lot of interest and I approve your suggestions on informing the other
                    Governments.</p>
                <p>Have you any objection to my reading your whole memorandum to the Big Four next
                        Monday.<anchor n="61" xml:id="d669-f1"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>H[<hi rendition="#small-caps">arry</hi>] S. T[<hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">ruman</hi>]</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d669-f1" n="61" xml:id="d669-f1-content">
                <p>April 15.</p>
